{
  "name": "Improved Winged Aspect",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain one of the following features of your choice.</p><ul><li><strong>Night Flyer.</strong> You gain a darkvision range of 120 feet. If you already possess darkvision, add 120 ft to its range.</li><li><strong>Agile Flyer.</strong> Your Speed increases by 10 feet and you do not provoke Opportunity Attacks when you fly out of an enemy's reach.</li><li><strong>Diving Raptor.</strong> When you use Primal Pounce, you can move up to double your Speed if your target is below you. If you moved at least 20 feet in this manner, the attack adds your Natural Weapons die to the damage again once.</li></ul>",
